WEBVTT

01:29.250 --> 01:34.450
[Never-Ending Summer]

01:35.930 --> 01:37.759
[Episode 25]

01:42.490 --> 01:43.080
Zhou Wan.

01:49.960 --> 01:50.710
Do you...

01:52.600 --> 01:54.130
really have to join Lan Yue?

01:58.070 --> 01:59.070
I have my reasons.

02:01.890 --> 02:02.480
I'm sorry

02:02.850 --> 02:03.640
for keeping you out so late

02:03.640 --> 02:05.020
without eating anything.

02:05.020 --> 02:07.080
How about we eat something together?

02:07.450 --> 02:08.539
If you park your car here,

02:08.539 --> 02:09.990
the traffic police will tow it away.

02:09.990 --> 02:11.150
Alright. It's getting late.

02:11.150 --> 02:12.120
Just go back now.

02:46.810 --> 02:48.010
Where did you just go?

02:51.329 --> 02:52.590
I went to see a cute guy.

02:55.280 --> 02:57.210
Think carefully before you speak.

02:57.770 --> 02:58.900
What did you just do?

02:59.400 --> 03:00.210
Jiang Yan and I

03:00.240 --> 03:01.640
went to visit his mother.

03:01.670 --> 03:02.620
I was afraid you'd overthink,

03:02.620 --> 03:03.960
so I didn't tell you the details.

03:03.960 --> 03:05.690
You were afraid I'd overthink?

03:06.670 --> 03:08.070
So you didn't overthink?

03:08.100 --> 03:08.840
Do I look like someone

03:08.840 --> 03:10.040
who would overthink?

03:10.100 --> 03:10.590
If you didn't overthink,

03:10.590 --> 03:11.520
why are you here?

03:13.450 --> 03:14.430
I was just passing by.

03:14.430 --> 03:15.140
You were tailing me.

03:15.140 --> 03:15.910
I was just passing by.

03:15.910 --> 03:16.440
You were tailing me.

03:16.440 --> 03:17.640
I was just passing by.

03:17.710 --> 03:18.840
You were tailing me.

03:25.240 --> 03:26.150
According to our agreement,

03:26.150 --> 03:26.840
I only promised

03:26.840 --> 03:28.030
to take care of your daily life,

03:28.030 --> 03:29.540
but it doesn't mean I have no freedom.

03:29.540 --> 03:30.280
Who I want to see

03:30.280 --> 03:31.100
and what I want to do

03:31.100 --> 03:32.050
are my own freedom.

03:32.050 --> 03:33.850
What do you mean by your freedom?

03:33.890 --> 03:35.090
Isn't this your job?

03:36.300 --> 03:37.630
I sent you a bunch of messages,

03:37.630 --> 03:38.800
asking you which brand of soy sauce,

03:38.800 --> 03:39.310
what vegetables

03:39.310 --> 03:39.960
and what eggs I should buy,

03:39.960 --> 03:41.590
and whether they should be organic or not.

03:41.590 --> 03:42.860
How am I supposed to know the differences?

03:42.860 --> 03:44.220
You didn't reply to any of my messages.

03:44.220 --> 03:45.130
I did reply.

03:45.160 --> 03:45.680
When did you reply?

03:45.680 --> 03:48.070
-Check your phone to see if you replied.
-I only didn't reply about the eggs.

03:48.070 --> 03:49.360
That's because you're already 28,

03:49.360 --> 03:50.470
and you're an adult.

03:50.470 --> 03:51.000
I can't believe you don't even know

03:51.000 --> 03:51.930
what eggs to buy.

03:51.950 --> 03:52.840
It's none of your business whether I know

03:52.840 --> 03:53.400
what eggs to buy.

03:53.400 --> 03:55.060
When I ask, you have to answer.

03:58.460 --> 04:00.190
Do you think you're a bossy CEO?

04:02.940 --> 04:03.720
Hold this.

04:06.790 --> 04:08.950
Carry one for me. This is heavy.

04:11.410 --> 04:13.450
Can't you be reasonable?

05:04.940 --> 05:07.830
♪ I'mma take a frozen heart ♪

05:09.000 --> 05:11.050
♪ Someone's gonna make it ♪

05:11.550 --> 05:14.290
♪ In the building of my broken part ♪

05:13.560 --> 05:15.360
So you can sleep well in this way?

05:15.670 --> 05:17.490
♪ Someone's gonna fix it ♪

05:18.550 --> 05:22.140
♪ I'm the only one guy
with the ten things crime ♪

05:20.500 --> 05:22.030
I can sleep well in this way.

05:23.050 --> 05:26.580
♪ I deserve a sanction in my mind ♪

05:28.340 --> 05:29.930
♪ Nescience doesn't mean ♪

05:29.960 --> 05:31.550
♪ That I can fly ♪

05:31.180 --> 05:31.840
Don't move.

05:33.830 --> 05:34.670
♪ Long time no see ♪

05:34.750 --> 05:36.090
♪ You haven't been here ♪

05:37.200 --> 05:39.630
♪ Stop watch has seen the changes ♪

05:38.040 --> 05:39.520
If you do this, I can't sleep.

05:39.520 --> 05:40.830
I don't care if you can sleep.

05:40.380 --> 05:42.320
♪ I'm sure you won't forget ♪

05:42.290 --> 05:43.530
It's fine if I can sleep.

05:42.350 --> 05:43.780
♪ The door you ever knocked ♪

06:10.010 --> 06:11.030
Ms. Zhou Wan.

06:11.170 --> 06:12.970
Someone sent you flowers again.

06:13.890 --> 06:15.190
Wan.

06:16.050 --> 06:17.140
Who is it this time?

06:18.720 --> 06:19.400
Xin.

06:19.560 --> 06:20.760
I have one more thing.

06:21.190 --> 06:22.230
Please go to

06:22.910 --> 06:24.950
the Project Archives Room
at Lan Yue's headquarters

06:24.950 --> 06:26.390
and help me pull out all the documents

06:26.390 --> 06:27.040
for Phase I.

06:27.040 --> 06:27.830
The more detailed, the better.

06:27.830 --> 06:28.630
Because I want to see

06:28.630 --> 06:29.270
if there is anything we can

06:29.270 --> 06:30.240
learn from for Phase II.

06:30.240 --> 06:31.570
Okay. I'll go right now.

06:38.700 --> 06:40.710
[Dear Miss Zhou,
just like you, these flowers

06:38.890 --> 06:40.320
Hello, Miss Zhou.

06:40.740 --> 06:42.330
[are attractive at first sight. Huang Hui]

06:40.920 --> 06:42.300
Did you see my flowers?

06:42.650 --> 06:44.120
Mr. Huang, thank you.

06:45.420 --> 06:46.830
I already told you last time

06:46.830 --> 06:48.040
you didn't have to buy me flowers.

06:48.040 --> 06:49.360
Ever since I met you

06:49.380 --> 06:50.440
for the first time,

06:50.720 --> 06:51.870
I've truly felt that

06:52.159 --> 06:54.220
flowers must be paired with a beauty.

06:55.870 --> 06:56.750
Mr. Huang, you also

06:56.750 --> 06:57.720
briefly learned about

06:57.720 --> 06:58.750
our project last time.

06:58.750 --> 06:59.920
Today, I will arrive at your company

06:59.920 --> 07:00.630
at the agreed time

07:00.630 --> 07:01.680
to have a detailed discussion with you

07:01.680 --> 07:03.410
and align our needs with yours.

07:03.560 --> 07:04.960
Do you think that's okay?

07:05.300 --> 07:06.220
Miss Zhou,

07:06.390 --> 07:08.360
I was just about to tell you about this.

07:08.360 --> 07:09.720
I need to go on a business trip
this afternoon

07:09.720 --> 07:10.950
for some urgent matters.

07:10.950 --> 07:11.680
So,

07:11.750 --> 07:12.480
I have to rush to

07:12.480 --> 07:14.540
a club in the suburbs to get prepared.

07:14.560 --> 07:16.270
Look. If it's convenient for you,

07:16.270 --> 07:17.360
can you come to the club

07:17.360 --> 07:19.090
so that we can talk face to face?

07:19.510 --> 07:20.480
Or maybe

07:20.480 --> 07:22.510
we can make another appointment
when you're back

07:22.510 --> 07:23.840
from the business trip?

07:24.920 --> 07:27.180
This business trip will take a long time.

07:27.510 --> 07:29.600
If you really want to talk,

07:29.920 --> 07:31.040
I can only spare this little bit

07:31.040 --> 07:32.370
of time this afternoon.

07:32.460 --> 07:33.920
I'll text you the address.

07:34.470 --> 07:35.060
Hello?

07:44.080 --> 07:45.080
This way, please.

07:50.020 --> 07:50.310
[Record]

07:50.370 --> 07:50.930
Mr. Huang.

07:50.690 --> 07:52.220
[Standard Mode]

07:50.950 --> 07:52.610
Miss Zhou from Lan Yue is here.

07:54.790 --> 07:55.520
Let her in.

07:55.740 --> 07:56.300
Okay.

07:57.360 --> 07:58.490
Please come in, Miss Zhou.

07:58.490 --> 07:59.950
Mr. Huang is right inside.

08:04.480 --> 08:05.480
Hello, Mr. Huang.

08:08.340 --> 08:09.380
I'm sorry

08:09.640 --> 08:11.530
for making you come all this way here.

08:11.530 --> 08:12.900
I really had no choice.

08:13.320 --> 08:14.990
I need to go on a business trip
urgently this afternoon.

08:14.990 --> 08:15.850
So,

08:15.870 --> 08:18.470
I had to rush over here
to prepare these things.

08:19.510 --> 08:20.170
Have a seat.

08:23.080 --> 08:24.650
You are too polite, Mr. Huang.

08:24.650 --> 08:25.510
This is the cooperation framework

08:25.510 --> 08:26.360
we've come up with

08:26.360 --> 08:28.180
based on our previous communication.

08:28.180 --> 08:29.430
You can take a look.

08:29.460 --> 08:30.380
If there's any...

08:30.380 --> 08:31.910
Look. I've been so busy that

08:32.150 --> 08:33.200
I forgot to ask you

08:33.200 --> 08:34.690
what you would like to drink.

08:34.690 --> 08:35.240
Coffee?

08:35.669 --> 08:36.400
Soft drinks?

08:37.380 --> 08:38.289
Or...

08:39.320 --> 08:40.190
some alcohol?

08:40.549 --> 08:42.409
You are too kind. I'm not thirsty.

08:45.870 --> 08:47.270
I'm allergic to alcohol.

08:50.370 --> 08:50.920
Okay.

08:55.280 --> 08:56.940
Miss Zhou, at such a young age,

08:57.010 --> 08:59.000
you're alreday a deputy director.

08:59.660 --> 09:02.270
I think you must be very smart

09:02.560 --> 09:04.630
and very resourceful.

09:05.450 --> 09:06.310
I'm glad that

09:06.500 --> 09:07.580
I can have a chance

09:08.320 --> 09:09.650
to experience it today.

09:12.230 --> 09:13.740
Look! The wine spilled on you!

09:13.740 --> 09:15.030
Come on. Let me wipe it for you.

09:15.030 --> 09:16.030
-I'll help you change into another outfit.
-I'm sorry.

09:16.030 --> 09:16.390
Okay?

09:16.390 --> 09:17.790
We can't continue today.

09:18.080 --> 09:18.910
Stop pretending!

09:18.910 --> 09:19.670
Let go of me!

09:29.130 --> 09:30.790
Don't you dare touch me again!

09:31.670 --> 09:32.480
Are you crazy?

09:32.480 --> 09:33.670
How dare you spray something on me?

09:33.670 --> 09:34.750
Don't you want to collaborate

09:34.750 --> 09:36.210
with our company anymore?

09:40.940 --> 09:42.250
I won't let you off!

09:46.340 --> 09:48.140
Alright. That's enough for now.

09:48.630 --> 09:49.390
Amazing.

09:49.390 --> 09:50.510
Let me see how to deal with

09:50.510 --> 09:51.310
your clothes.

09:52.000 --> 09:54.130
Let me smooth them out for you. Come on.

09:54.720 --> 09:55.270
My motorcycle is broken.

09:55.270 --> 09:56.390
Can you fix it, sir?

09:56.390 --> 09:57.150
Not today.

09:57.170 --> 09:59.700
Can't you see
I'm busy looking after my child?

10:01.910 --> 10:02.960
Look who's here!

10:02.960 --> 10:04.280
What a rare guest!

10:08.300 --> 10:09.320
You've been back from abroad for so long,

10:09.320 --> 10:10.360
and I've called you so many times,

10:10.360 --> 10:11.100
but you never came over.

10:11.100 --> 10:12.160
Today, why are you...

10:12.160 --> 10:13.060
After being busy for a couple of days,

10:13.060 --> 10:15.240
I had some free time,
so I came to visit you.

10:15.240 --> 10:16.040
This is my son.

10:17.200 --> 10:17.910
-Uncle Lu.
-Is this stuff of yours

10:17.910 --> 10:19.240
still useful or not?

10:19.240 --> 10:20.790
If not, I'll just sell it as scrap.

10:20.790 --> 10:22.750
That item can't be bought anymore now.

10:22.750 --> 10:23.970
It's a vintage part.

10:24.260 --> 10:25.860
Let me make an introduction.

10:27.110 --> 10:27.820
This is...

10:28.240 --> 10:28.750
Xixiao,

10:28.750 --> 10:29.360
Lu Xixiao,

10:29.360 --> 10:31.020
the one I often tell you about.

10:31.100 --> 10:32.010
Lu Xixiao.

10:32.840 --> 10:33.320
Right.

10:33.520 --> 10:34.900
This is my wife.

10:34.920 --> 10:35.630
Come out now.

10:35.630 --> 10:37.020
Don't let our guest hold the baby.

10:37.020 --> 10:37.720
Sit here.

10:37.720 --> 10:39.120
Let's go inside and play.

10:41.650 --> 10:43.860
Come on, Rice Ball. I'll play with you.

10:44.800 --> 10:45.530
What is this?

10:46.920 --> 10:48.310
She tends to
throw away everything of mine.

10:48.310 --> 10:50.640
It's been 10 years.
It can't be bought now.

10:52.280 --> 10:54.810
How is it?
This place has changed a lot, right?

10:56.320 --> 10:57.650
It hasn't changed much.

11:03.170 --> 11:04.380
Luo He is dead.

11:07.760 --> 11:08.820
When did it happen?

11:09.590 --> 11:10.670
Just a few days ago.

11:11.290 --> 11:12.240
He was imprisoned for a few years.

11:12.240 --> 11:14.680
He still goofed off
after being released from prison.

11:14.680 --> 11:16.270
He drank every day

11:16.270 --> 11:17.620
and partied every night.

11:17.620 --> 11:18.550
Later, he drank so much

11:18.550 --> 11:20.280
that he drank himself to death.

11:21.780 --> 11:22.510
Do you know

11:22.510 --> 11:23.910
why I'm telling you this?

11:24.940 --> 11:25.650
Why?

11:26.690 --> 11:28.690
I want you to drink less.

11:30.130 --> 11:30.860
Don't worry.

11:30.870 --> 11:32.330
I don't drink much anyway.

11:33.670 --> 11:34.750
It's been so many years

11:34.750 --> 11:35.950
since that happened.

11:36.830 --> 11:37.890
Luo He is dead, too.

11:38.610 --> 11:39.750
I think some things

11:39.750 --> 11:41.030
should just fade away.

11:42.220 --> 11:43.950
They faded away a long time ago.

11:48.110 --> 11:49.470
Do you still like her?

11:58.610 --> 11:59.600
If you like her,

11:59.600 --> 12:01.270
just put more effort
in your relationship with her.

12:01.270 --> 12:03.800
Why do you have to
make this so heartbreaking?

12:04.630 --> 12:05.720
Even in an idol drama,

12:05.720 --> 12:06.780
shouldn't there be

12:06.790 --> 12:08.260
a happy ending by now?

12:08.290 --> 12:09.690
She's living in my place.

12:10.250 --> 12:10.890
What?

12:12.530 --> 12:13.340
What? What?

12:14.950 --> 12:16.720
Well, you've been back
from abroad for so long,

12:16.720 --> 12:18.030
but you never came visit me.

12:18.030 --> 12:19.500
It turns out you have someone
like a little heater at home

12:19.500 --> 12:21.360
that gives your warmth secretly.

12:21.710 --> 12:24.040
She's just staying in my place
for a couple of days.

12:24.040 --> 12:24.870
When she can't stay there anymore,

12:24.870 --> 12:25.670
she'll leave.

12:27.390 --> 12:28.780
Will that day really come?

12:28.780 --> 12:31.910
It isn't that easy to forget the girl

12:32.360 --> 12:33.270
you had a crush on

12:33.270 --> 12:34.730
when you were a boy, right?

12:38.280 --> 12:39.270
I don't know whether that day

12:39.270 --> 12:40.600
will really come or not.

12:40.620 --> 12:42.820
But anyway, with her staying by my side,

12:43.790 --> 12:45.720
it won't be so unbearable at least.

12:45.800 --> 12:46.770
As for this newspaper...

12:46.770 --> 12:48.170
Look. It's so worn out.

12:48.200 --> 12:49.110
But it's not broken yet.

12:49.110 --> 12:49.720
I remember

12:49.720 --> 12:51.790
my father kept this

12:52.330 --> 12:53.550
when the building materials factory

12:53.550 --> 12:54.880
he worked for went bankrupt.

12:54.880 --> 12:55.790
It's so dirty.

12:55.790 --> 12:57.390
Why are you still keeping it?

12:58.250 --> 13:00.650
It's been 20 years,
but it's not broken yet.

13:00.780 --> 13:01.350
[The "Quality Scandal" of Jun'an
Building Materials Led to Bankruptcy]

13:01.370 --> 13:02.090
[The Entrepreneurial Role Model
Faces Huge Debts and Charges]

13:06.360 --> 13:07.360
Let me take a look.

13:07.900 --> 13:08.960
[A Family Tragedy
Caused by Dishonesty in Quality]

13:08.990 --> 13:10.150
[The Commercial Vicissitudes of Zhou Jun,
the Building Materials Businessman]

13:09.900 --> 13:11.180
The quality is good.

13:14.790 --> 13:15.890
[The "Quality Scandal" of Jun'an
Building Materials Led to Bankruptcy]

13:15.920 --> 13:17.150
