13:21.030 --> 13:21.570
Let me wipe it for you.

13:21.570 --> 13:22.840
Come on. Let me wipe it for you.

13:22.840 --> 13:23.810
-I'll help you change into another outfit.
-I'm sorry.

13:23.810 --> 13:24.200
Okay?

13:24.200 --> 13:25.480
We can't continue today.

13:25.480 --> 13:26.270
Stop pretending!

13:26.270 --> 13:27.000
Let go of me!

13:36.390 --> 13:37.250
Hello, Xixiao.

13:37.510 --> 13:37.990
Hello?

13:38.440 --> 13:39.840
Help me find

13:39.840 --> 13:42.020
a reliable information consulting company.

13:42.020 --> 13:42.870
I need to look into something.

13:42.870 --> 13:43.670
Hey,

13:43.940 --> 13:45.670
you refused to
take charge of this art exhibition

13:45.670 --> 13:47.200
and turned to work on urban construction,

13:47.200 --> 13:48.320
and now you're playing
the mystery detective game,

13:48.320 --> 13:48.790
huh?

13:49.150 --> 13:50.600
I'm telling you to find it,
so just do it.

13:50.600 --> 13:52.310
Do it now,
and text it to me when you find it.

13:52.310 --> 13:53.370
Okay, okay, okay.

13:53.480 --> 13:55.340
It's just like I owing this to you.

13:55.890 --> 13:57.610
Don't delay submitting the drafts.

13:57.610 --> 13:58.640
Okay. I got it.

14:04.190 --> 14:05.650
What are you listening to?

14:10.430 --> 14:11.360
I'm in a meeting.

14:14.340 --> 14:15.270
I'll send the documents

14:15.270 --> 14:16.000
to you later.

14:29.220 --> 14:31.300
