15:16.230 --> 15:17.420
Morning, Wan.

15:17.900 --> 15:18.510
Morning.

15:18.000 --> 15:25.320
[Lan Yue Group]

15:18.540 --> 15:19.440
You asked me to find the documents

15:19.440 --> 15:20.790
of Phase I of the resort,

15:20.790 --> 15:22.000
but these files
are not in the Project Archives Room.

15:22.000 --> 15:22.910
They said 20 years ago,

15:22.910 --> 15:24.480
the archives room
was not well established yet.

15:24.480 --> 15:25.200
Each manager probably

15:25.200 --> 15:26.200
kept the files

15:26.200 --> 15:27.060
respectively.

15:28.030 --> 15:29.690
So the documents of Phase I of the resort

15:29.690 --> 15:32.350
-are kept by Mr. Lu?
-What are you talking about?

15:33.690 --> 15:34.360
Nothing.

15:35.900 --> 15:37.190
So you're Zhou Wan?

15:38.390 --> 15:38.870
Yes.

15:39.400 --> 15:40.460
What are you doing?

15:41.140 --> 15:42.030
What are you doing?

15:42.030 --> 15:42.850
You shameless woman!

15:42.850 --> 15:44.310
How dare you seduce my husband?

15:44.310 --> 15:46.500
You behave so badly at such a young age!

15:46.600 --> 15:47.440
You little home wrecker!

15:47.440 --> 15:48.780
You have such a promiscuous lifestyle.

15:48.780 --> 15:50.180
Come on, everyone! Come take a look!

15:50.180 --> 15:51.390
Everyone in the back, come take a look!

15:51.390 --> 15:53.320
-Come and catch the mistress now!
-There's a mistress here!

15:53.320 --> 15:54.600
Nowadays, some young girls

15:54.600 --> 15:55.390
are really so unscrupulous

15:55.390 --> 15:57.290
in order to snatch men from their wives.

15:57.290 --> 15:58.260
Let me tell you.

15:58.530 --> 16:00.710
Xinghai and Lan Yue can collaborate.

16:00.730 --> 16:01.400
But you

16:01.430 --> 16:02.910
-must leave Lan Yue!
-Who are you asking to leave?

16:02.910 --> 16:04.030
I'll make you leave, believe it or not!

16:04.030 --> 16:06.120
What are you talking about
in broad daylight?

16:06.120 --> 16:07.410
You must be Mrs. Huang.

16:07.920 --> 16:09.030
I advise you to figure out

16:09.030 --> 16:10.050
some facts first.

16:10.190 --> 16:10.960
Otherwise, I'll sue you

16:10.960 --> 16:12.170
for personal attacks and defamation.

16:12.170 --> 16:13.550
Who are you suing for personal attacks?

16:13.550 --> 16:15.030
Don't you dare touch her!
I'd like to see who dares to touch her!

16:15.030 --> 16:16.960
Stop making trouble here! Get out!

16:17.570 --> 16:18.170
Out!

16:18.200 --> 16:18.880
You're really something.

16:18.880 --> 16:19.480
Don't think you'll be fine

16:19.480 --> 16:20.270
just because two men are protecting you.

16:20.270 --> 16:20.910
Let me tell you!

16:20.910 --> 16:21.690
I won't let you off!

16:21.690 --> 16:22.640
You behave so badly at such a young age!

16:22.640 --> 16:23.610
Leave at once!

16:23.840 --> 16:25.300
Where are the security guards?

16:25.300 --> 16:26.630
Hurry up! Leave at once!

16:26.750 --> 16:28.740
Hurry! Leave at once!

16:31.840 --> 16:32.630
You're amazing, Xin.

16:32.630 --> 16:33.610
Are you okay?

16:33.640 --> 16:35.770
I'm fine. Where did you get the crutch?

16:35.910 --> 16:36.720
It's mine.

16:36.960 --> 16:38.020
The crutch is mine.

16:38.040 --> 16:39.390
I'm sorry!

16:40.430 --> 16:41.960
I still need to return the crutch.

16:41.960 --> 16:42.630
Thank you.

16:42.650 --> 16:43.580
You're welcome.

16:45.200 --> 16:46.130
I'm sorry.

16:46.370 --> 16:47.170
It's alright.

16:47.360 --> 16:48.510
Don't throw it on the ground like that
next time.

16:48.510 --> 16:49.530
Okay, okay, okay.

16:49.960 --> 16:50.600
Thank you.

17:04.670 --> 17:06.069
Where did you pop up from?

17:10.000 --> 17:10.720
Let me tell you guys.

17:10.720 --> 17:12.000
If it weren't for me today,

17:12.000 --> 17:12.750
Director Zhou's face

17:12.750 --> 17:14.280
would have been scratched.

17:14.310 --> 17:15.030
At that time, I just took

17:15.030 --> 17:16.089
a crutch like this, and I...

17:16.089 --> 17:16.800
What happened?

17:16.800 --> 17:18.730
I tried to hit them with the crutch.

17:18.869 --> 17:21.150
-He asked me to drink once I went in.
-Those three women ran away. Then what?

17:21.150 --> 17:24.160
-After that...
-The guards didn't even move! Three women!

17:24.160 --> 17:27.069
-He stood up even without wearing pants.
-Well, the one beside them...

17:27.069 --> 17:28.000
Then he came over and started to

17:28.000 --> 17:29.310
touch me with his filthy hands.

17:29.310 --> 17:30.680
Stop making noise!

17:30.920 --> 17:31.680
Can't you hear this?

17:31.680 --> 17:33.210
We are talking inside here.

17:38.550 --> 17:39.200
What?

17:41.300 --> 17:41.900
I was fine.

17:42.400 --> 17:43.510
I brought pepper spray

17:43.510 --> 17:44.710
and a personal alarm.

17:45.080 --> 17:46.200
What's more, I also recorded it

17:46.200 --> 17:47.400
just to prevent this.

17:49.850 --> 17:51.380
I'll give you some time off.

17:52.000 --> 17:54.230
Go home and get a good rest
for a couple of days.

17:54.230 --> 17:54.970
But tonight,

17:55.000 --> 17:56.130
I might go back late.

17:56.130 --> 17:58.130
There's something I need to handle.

17:59.070 --> 17:59.750
You said it.

18:00.540 --> 18:01.210
I said it.

18:02.300 --> 18:03.460
So I can really take some time off?

18:03.460 --> 18:05.320
You can really take some time off.

18:15.930 --> 18:16.810
Wei!

18:25.250 --> 18:26.720
Go investigate Xinghai Entertainment.

18:26.720 --> 18:27.490
Okay.

18:44.250 --> 18:44.940
[Analysis of Target Guest Groups]

18:44.970 --> 18:45.730
[01 High-End Vacation Guest Group]

18:45.760 --> 18:46.500
[02 Corporate Team-Building
and Conference Guests]

18:46.530 --> 18:47.180
[03 Young-Parent-Child Family Group]

18:56.640 --> 18:57.200
Wan,

18:57.220 --> 18:58.610
take a look at what I've sent you.

18:58.610 --> 19:00.130
Xinghai Entertainment is in chaos.

19:00.130 --> 19:01.310
There are already over a dozen victims

19:01.020 --> 19:03.110
[Huang Hui, CEO of Xinghai Entertainment,
was accused of]

19:01.310 --> 19:02.680
who have stepped forward.

19:02.680 --> 19:03.510
There are also some audio recordings

19:03.140 --> 19:04.600
[harassing female employees
for a long time.]

19:03.510 --> 19:04.940
and chat logs that have been leaked.

19:04.620 --> 19:05.600
[Multiple victims spoke out.]

19:04.960 --> 19:06.820
There are heated debates online.

19:13.840 --> 19:18.950
[Key Audio Recordings Are Exposed:
Naked Threats in Business Negotiations]

19:25.260 --> 19:29.230
[Key Audio Recordings Are Exposed:
Naked Threats in Business Negotiations]

19:47.730 --> 19:51.450
[03 Young-Parent-Child Family Group]

19:53.960 --> 19:54.890
-Hello?
-Hello?

19:55.270 --> 19:56.730
This... This is Jiang Fan.

19:56.830 --> 19:58.200
I need to talk to Xixiao
about something urgent.

19:58.200 --> 19:59.600
He didn't answer my call.

19:59.960 --> 20:00.830
Are you at home?

20:01.690 --> 20:03.000
Then please help me find something.

20:03.000 --> 20:04.030
I need Xixiao's

20:04.030 --> 20:04.940
award certificate.

20:04.940 --> 20:06.070
Award certificate?

20:06.070 --> 20:06.590
Yes.

20:07.070 --> 20:08.230
Yes, please help me find it.

20:08.230 --> 20:09.490
Do you know where it is?

20:09.830 --> 20:12.430
It seems to be in a cabinet in his room.

20:13.160 --> 20:14.620
Which cabinet in his room?

20:15.720 --> 20:17.210
Which cabinet?

20:17.400 --> 20:18.270
I don't know.

20:18.910 --> 20:21.310
Just help me search all the cabinets.
Okay?

20:21.790 --> 20:22.550
I have something else to do.

20:22.550 --> 20:23.070
-I have to hang up now.
-Then later, will you

20:23.070 --> 20:25.070
ask a courier to come pick it up or...

20:40.790 --> 20:46.030
[Fluoxetine]

21:00.830 --> 21:02.080
[Certificate of Honor]

21:20.850 --> 21:23.660
[Psychological Counseling Record]

21:26.590 --> 21:30.710
[Psychological Counseling Record]

21:54.130 --> 21:55.910
September 5, 2016.

21:56.150 --> 21:56.880
Rainy.

21:58.030 --> 21:59.160
Autumn has arrived,

21:59.200 --> 22:00.730
but it doesn't feel like it.

22:01.060 --> 22:02.100
The weather is still hot,

22:02.100 --> 22:03.250
and it's still noisy.

22:02.860 --> 22:04.430
[The sunshine is strong,
which makes my eyes hurt.]

22:04.130 --> 22:05.330
It still feels like summer.

22:04.450 --> 22:05.830
[The cicadas
are still chirping tirelessly.]

22:05.850 --> 22:07.490
[And I feel everything is eerily quiet.]

22:07.510 --> 22:09.390
[It's so quiet
that I can hear my own heartbeat.]

22:09.860 --> 22:12.330
December 15, 2016.

22:12.370 --> 22:12.940
Sunny.

22:14.400 --> 22:15.200
It's snowing.

22:16.140 --> 22:17.640
The sound of the snow is loud.

22:17.640 --> 22:19.440
I still can't fall asleep today.

22:21.570 --> 22:23.240
January 1, 2018.

22:23.840 --> 22:24.580
Sunny.

22:25.030 --> 22:26.590
This winter, I hid in the snowless

22:26.590 --> 22:28.000
Southern Hemisphere.

22:28.750 --> 22:29.350
It's another

22:29.350 --> 22:30.950
meaningless New Year's Eve.

22:31.880 --> 22:32.680
I suffer from insomnia

22:32.680 --> 22:33.790
on every statutory

22:34.060 --> 22:35.270
happy holiday.

22:42.200 --> 22:45.010
November 18, 2022.

22:45.670 --> 22:46.270
Sunny.

22:47.560 --> 22:49.440
I'd like to say happy birthday to myself.

22:49.440 --> 22:52.040
She wished
I could always dare to love and hate,

22:52.410 --> 22:54.540
and everything could
go smoothly for me forever.

22:54.540 --> 22:55.790
As things stand now,

22:56.160 --> 22:57.760
blessings feel like curses.

22:58.370 --> 22:59.530
I only feel numb.

22:59.550 --> 23:01.080
I'm only living in the past,

23:01.600 --> 23:03.600
and I'm only haunted by nightmares.

23:13.520 --> 23:15.870
March 25, 2025.

23:15.910 --> 23:16.570
Sunny.

23:17.780 --> 23:19.040
Happy birthday to you.

23:30.130 --> 23:32.980
May 28, 2026.

23:33.510 --> 23:34.200
Sunny.

23:34.680 --> 23:37.010
I can't believe she hasn't changed at all.

23:37.590 --> 23:39.250
How dare she not change at all?

23:44.770 --> 23:46.550
June 9, 2026.

23:46.890 --> 23:47.440
Sunny.

23:49.550 --> 23:50.680
If getting entangled again

23:50.680 --> 23:51.610
feels like this,

23:52.410 --> 23:54.540
we might as well keep being entangled.

24:33.950 --> 24:35.410
Are you going to cook?

24:37.940 --> 24:38.740
What's wrong?

24:39.160 --> 24:40.360
You taught me before.

24:41.240 --> 24:42.500
Have you forgotten it?

24:44.510 --> 24:45.810
You didn't mention it,

24:46.190 --> 24:47.920
and I could hardly remember it.

24:51.210 --> 24:51.960
I can only make some

24:51.960 --> 24:53.090
very simple dishes.

24:53.220 --> 24:54.480
Just make do with them.

24:56.400 --> 24:56.890
Apron.

25:27.930 --> 25:29.790
Now you know how to play nice, huh?

25:32.360 --> 25:33.300
You actually didn't have to

25:33.300 --> 25:34.450
do all this for me.

25:36.410 --> 25:37.360
Xinghai and Lan Yue

25:37.360 --> 25:39.370
have had
many long-term collaborations before.

25:39.370 --> 25:40.700
Now that you've done this,

25:40.700 --> 25:41.940
Lan Yue will probably lose a

25:41.940 --> 25:43.070
long-term partner.

25:44.690 --> 25:46.290
A tall tree catches the wind.

25:46.530 --> 25:47.980
With so many people watching,

25:47.980 --> 25:48.870
I don't want...

25:51.830 --> 25:53.700
I don't want you and the project

25:54.770 --> 25:56.370
to be further affected by me.

25:59.090 --> 26:00.330
No one can bully you,

26:01.550 --> 26:02.150
except me.

26:06.220 --> 26:06.940
Clean up the table.

26:06.940 --> 26:08.270
Dinner is almost ready.

26:36.760 --> 26:37.510
I'm sorry.

26:43.780 --> 26:44.840
Stop apologizing.

26:45.770 --> 26:47.430
Next time, if you get bullied,

26:48.030 --> 26:48.960
just fight back.

26:51.340 --> 26:52.660
Are you ill?

26:59.370 --> 27:00.110
I saw your

27:00.110 --> 27:01.440
psychotherapy report.

27:03.890 --> 27:05.290
I didn't do it on purpose.

27:10.280 --> 27:10.880
Zhou Wan.

27:14.560 --> 27:15.570
My illness

27:16.470 --> 27:17.670
wasn't caused by you.

27:20.240 --> 27:21.640
After my mom passed away,

27:21.810 --> 27:23.740
I started to suffer from insomnia.

27:25.500 --> 27:26.440
During that time, I was

27:26.440 --> 27:27.500
pretty depressed.

27:28.240 --> 27:29.310
Back then, you might not have noticed

27:29.310 --> 27:30.140
anything wrong with me,

27:30.140 --> 27:30.730
but...

27:33.150 --> 27:34.520
I knew exactly

27:34.680 --> 27:35.740
what state I was in.

27:38.290 --> 27:40.150
What's more, after you appeared,

27:41.160 --> 27:43.420
those symptoms disappeared gradually.

27:45.020 --> 27:46.350
So it was not your fault.

27:47.830 --> 27:48.700
Now that you're here,

27:48.700 --> 27:50.300
I actually can sleep better.

28:07.000 --> 28:08.680
I once resented you indeed.

28:11.570 --> 28:12.160
However,

28:15.040 --> 28:16.200
didn't you also hold my hand

28:16.200 --> 28:17.110
and tell me this when we were

28:17.110 --> 28:18.150
high in the air?

28:20.140 --> 28:22.070
From now on, we have to move forward

28:23.070 --> 28:23.900
and move up.

28:28.360 --> 28:30.090
Actually, for all these years,

28:30.620 --> 28:32.230
what you said back then

28:32.490 --> 28:34.890
has helped me
get through many tough times.

28:36.210 --> 28:37.940
So, if we really think about it,

28:40.560 --> 28:42.020
you don't owe me anything.

28:46.140 --> 28:47.520
If you want to leave,

28:49.720 --> 28:50.980
you can leave anytime.

28:56.920 --> 28:58.460
Haven't you said that

28:58.860 --> 28:59.550
when I'm here,

28:59.550 --> 29:01.010
you can sleep a bit better?

29:03.160 --> 29:04.820
I won't leave until

29:05.220 --> 29:06.220
I see you recover.

29:07.490 --> 29:08.610
Zhou Wan, I don't want you

29:08.610 --> 29:12.160
-to this just because of your...
-I'm not doing this out of guilt.

29:12.160 --> 29:13.220
Nor am I...

29:14.300 --> 29:16.360
Nor am I doing this out of pity for you.

29:18.880 --> 29:20.610
I genuinely want you to be well.

29:24.200 --> 29:25.800
Even if we might not be able to

29:27.470 --> 29:29.080
go back to how we used to be,

29:32.200 --> 29:34.000
even if we can't remain friends,

29:36.600 --> 29:38.460
or even if you might still hate me,

29:41.560 --> 29:42.580
I really hope

29:42.590 --> 29:43.450
you can be okay.

29:56.580 --> 29:57.230
Alright.

30:01.110 --> 30:02.610
Then I also want you to know

30:10.290 --> 30:12.620
you've never been the cause of my illness,

30:17.690 --> 30:18.640
but the cure.

30:25.730 --> 30:26.840
Are you going to eat

30:27.810 --> 30:29.340
this bowl of noodles or not?

30:32.120 --> 30:32.600
You...

30:34.400 --> 30:35.590
You're holding my hands.

30:35.590 --> 30:36.480
I can't eat it.

30:44.230 --> 30:45.420
Do you want me to feed you?

30:45.420 --> 30:46.020
No.

31:35.300 --> 31:36.630
Focus on the road ahead.

31:46.590 --> 31:48.410
This is the information we've gathered

31:48.410 --> 31:49.760
about the bankruptcy

31:49.780 --> 31:51.000
of Jun'an Building Materials Factory.

31:51.000 --> 31:52.480
As it's been 20 years,

31:52.900 --> 31:54.830
there's not much we could collect.

32:00.810 --> 32:02.720
So the product quality issue back then

32:02.720 --> 32:04.320
was caused by the materials?

32:04.600 --> 32:05.810
Before that,

32:05.830 --> 32:07.530
the profitability
of Jun'an Building Materials Factory

32:07.530 --> 32:08.340
was just average,

32:08.340 --> 32:09.450
but the reputation of its products

32:09.450 --> 32:10.330
was pretty good.

32:10.330 --> 32:11.990
After that incident,

32:12.110 --> 32:13.560
they couldn't hold on anymore,

32:13.560 --> 32:15.160
and they soon went bankrupt.

32:18.010 --> 32:19.620
I think at that time,

32:20.550 --> 32:22.310
the construction of Phase I

32:22.310 --> 32:24.570
of Lan Yue Resort was under preparation.

32:24.640 --> 32:26.430
According to our investigation,

32:26.430 --> 32:28.240
Lan Yue did send someone

32:28.240 --> 32:29.580
to contact Zhou Jun privately back then

32:29.580 --> 32:32.030
as they wanted to acquire
Jun'an Building Materials Factory.

32:32.030 --> 32:33.490
But the deal fell through.

32:33.560 --> 32:34.400
Later, Jun'an Building Materials Factory

32:34.400 --> 32:35.370
went bankrupt, didn't it?

32:35.370 --> 32:36.400
So they missed that

32:36.400 --> 32:38.000
opportunity to be acquired.

32:38.370 --> 32:39.520
Now can we still find

32:39.550 --> 32:41.110
the suppliers who provided materials for

32:41.110 --> 32:43.840
Jun'an Building Materials Factory
at that time?

32:44.770 --> 32:46.810
It has been really a long time.

32:47.130 --> 32:47.990
In this industry,

32:47.990 --> 32:50.290
the recorded information
was limited back then,

32:50.290 --> 32:51.420
with high mobility.

32:51.530 --> 32:52.560
Many companies changed names

32:52.560 --> 32:53.560
or went bankrupt.

32:53.590 --> 32:54.930
We can only do our best.

32:57.460 --> 32:58.220
Alright.

32:59.990 --> 33:01.190
Thanks for your help.

33:01.200 --> 33:02.110
If you can find

33:02.110 --> 33:02.920
even just

33:02.920 --> 33:03.750
a bit of a clue,

33:03.750 --> 33:05.070
let me know as soon as possible, too.

33:05.070 --> 33:06.440
Okay. Don't worry.

33:06.440 --> 33:08.040
We'll certainly do our best.

33:08.050 --> 33:08.910
Let's keep in touch.

33:08.910 --> 33:09.420
Okay.

33:15.220 --> 33:17.230
Have you seen the recent trending topics?

33:17.230 --> 33:19.070
The Xinghai incident is getting bigger.

33:19.070 --> 33:19.790
I've heard

33:19.790 --> 33:21.160
someone suggested
a strict internal investigation

33:21.160 --> 33:22.750
into Xinghai Entertainment.

33:22.750 --> 33:23.600
It's that serious?

33:23.600 --> 33:25.400
Huang Hui is really ruthless.

33:25.960 --> 33:26.960
He got married

33:26.960 --> 33:28.610
and then took over
his father-in-law's company.

33:28.610 --> 33:30.810
I didn't expect
he would dare to do this.

33:31.270 --> 33:32.790
I've heard Mrs. Huang

33:32.790 --> 33:33.830
is truly ruthless.

33:33.830 --> 33:34.790
Previously in their company,

33:34.790 --> 33:36.160
the young women who had been harassed

33:36.160 --> 33:37.960
were all fired by her personally.

33:37.960 --> 33:38.880
It can't be.

33:41.630 --> 33:43.090
Isn't she quite ruthless?

33:43.110 --> 33:43.920
-Wan.
-Wan.

33:44.000 --> 33:44.550
Hello.

33:44.550 --> 33:45.310
Wan.

33:45.440 --> 33:46.810
Why are you coming to work so soon?

33:46.810 --> 33:48.590
Why don't you rest for a few more days?

33:48.590 --> 33:49.400
I'm fine.

33:49.400 --> 33:50.860
Don't let it delay my work.

33:52.510 --> 33:54.960
Wan, we all know

33:55.110 --> 33:56.350
you suffered a great grievance

33:56.350 --> 33:57.810
for the company this time.

34:09.280 --> 34:10.909
It's not really a grievance.

34:12.239 --> 34:14.630
It's just that thinking about it
afterwards,

34:14.630 --> 34:15.989
I still feel a bit sad.

34:19.989 --> 34:22.139
Huang Hui was punished this time.

34:22.530 --> 34:23.790
But for those victims,

34:24.300 --> 34:25.230
losing their jobs

34:25.230 --> 34:26.560
is an established fact.

34:26.800 --> 34:27.530
And now people are gossiping

34:27.530 --> 34:28.790
about them once again.

34:29.330 --> 34:30.790
This is secondary damage.

34:34.360 --> 34:35.889
But there's some good news.

34:36.190 --> 34:38.020
After our company's HR Department
found out about it,

34:38.020 --> 34:39.150
they specifically opened up

34:39.150 --> 34:40.300
a reporting channel.

34:40.300 --> 34:41.880
If this happens again,

34:42.300 --> 34:43.230
they will immediately

34:43.230 --> 34:44.190
protect our privacy

34:44.190 --> 34:45.389
and personal safety.

34:53.260 --> 34:54.860
Have some jelly and cheer up.

34:56.540 --> 34:58.070
In the future,
when you socialize with clients,

34:58.070 --> 34:58.510
you can also

34:58.510 --> 34:59.360
designate me

34:59.360 --> 35:00.380
as your emergency contact.

35:00.380 --> 35:01.670
We can look out for each other.

35:01.670 --> 35:02.070
Okay.

35:03.550 --> 35:04.410
Give you a Like.

35:09.360 --> 35:10.590
Let's get ready for the meeting.

35:10.590 --> 35:12.590
-Wan is always the considerate one.
-Director Jiang.

35:12.590 --> 35:13.520
Director Jiang.

35:18.520 --> 35:19.970
It's time for the meeting.

35:19.970 --> 35:20.530
Hello.

35:20.560 --> 35:21.040
Mr. Lu.

35:26.080 --> 35:26.880
What's wrong?

35:27.870 --> 35:29.600
Why are you pulling a long face?

35:31.320 --> 35:32.180
What happened?

35:32.510 --> 35:33.190
N-Nothing.

35:34.590 --> 35:35.260
Nothing.

35:35.290 --> 35:36.000
Then let's

35:36.000 --> 35:37.260
officially begin now.

35:37.460 --> 35:39.040
Originally, our first choice

35:39.040 --> 35:40.330
was Xinghai Entertainment.

35:40.330 --> 35:41.150
But you all know

35:41.150 --> 35:42.190
the situation now.

35:42.190 --> 35:44.000
The only ones left are Wanhehui

35:44.000 --> 35:45.880
and Chaoshang Global

35:45.880 --> 35:47.360
that have this kind of capability.

35:47.360 --> 35:49.630
Yes, but Wanhehui

35:49.630 --> 35:51.220
insists on having operational autonomy

35:51.220 --> 35:52.700
and won't budge on the revenue split.

35:52.700 --> 35:53.440
This means that

35:53.440 --> 35:54.770
more than half of our resort

35:54.770 --> 35:56.280
will be operated for their benefits.

35:56.280 --> 35:58.000
It's hard for Chaoshang Global's IP

35:58.000 --> 35:58.840
to be compatible with

35:58.840 --> 36:00.110
the theme of our project.

36:00.110 --> 36:01.650
If we collaborate with them,

36:01.650 --> 36:03.980
the entire plan might need to be adjusted.

36:06.720 --> 36:07.550
Don't we still have

36:07.550 --> 36:08.350
a backup plan?

36:09.190 --> 36:10.190
It's to collaborate with

36:10.190 --> 36:11.460
multiple brands that have their own IP

36:11.460 --> 36:12.720
on separate projects.

36:14.210 --> 36:14.950
Good idea.

36:15.960 --> 36:17.670
Although this will

36:17.690 --> 36:19.610
increase the subsequent management costs,

36:19.610 --> 36:21.600
the configuration will be more flexible,

36:21.600 --> 36:23.800
and the total cost will also be reduced.

36:23.800 --> 36:24.800
I currently have

36:24.800 --> 36:25.860
many high-quality resources.

36:25.860 --> 36:27.800
They're quite specialized
in their respective fields.

36:27.800 --> 36:29.260
We can try to contact them.

36:34.330 --> 36:36.310
This model is okay,

36:37.040 --> 36:38.300
but there is a problem.

36:38.600 --> 36:39.760
If too many brands

36:39.760 --> 36:40.860
are mixed together,

36:40.860 --> 36:42.660
it will reduce our recognition.

36:42.880 --> 36:44.230
In the end, it won't

36:44.230 --> 36:45.140
come out well.

36:45.160 --> 36:45.870
Therefore,

36:46.190 --> 36:47.190
the consumer experience

36:47.190 --> 36:48.190
will be degraded.

36:50.790 --> 36:51.990
Let's think about it.

36:59.710 --> 37:00.570
How about this?

37:00.840 --> 37:02.640
Zhao Lei, Cheng Feng, you two...

37:02.770 --> 37:05.080
can work with Director Jiang

37:05.260 --> 37:07.390
to screen out a list of partners

37:07.420 --> 37:09.150
that fit our brand tone

37:09.150 --> 37:10.150
as much as you can.

37:10.150 --> 37:11.190
-Okay.
-Got it.

37:12.080 --> 37:13.010
Director Jiang.

37:14.960 --> 37:15.690
Is that okay?

37:19.270 --> 37:20.270
No problem.

37:20.290 --> 37:21.630
Without Xinghai Entertainment,

37:21.630 --> 37:23.630
the Earth is still turning as usual.

37:23.640 --> 37:24.520
Good.

37:25.360 --> 37:25.850
Well...

37:28.800 --> 37:30.060
I still have another

37:31.600 --> 37:32.790
very bold idea.

37:34.510 --> 37:35.680
How bold is it?

37:36.460 --> 37:37.420
Very bold.

37:39.100 --> 37:40.700
You really dare to think big.

37:41.070 --> 37:41.960
You actually thought of

37:41.960 --> 37:43.250
creating our own IP.

37:43.550 --> 37:45.480
Where did you get your confidence?

37:46.700 --> 37:48.630
Aunt, considering our current situation,

37:48.630 --> 37:50.830
instead of settling for less every day,

37:51.060 --> 37:52.570
why not take bold steps

37:52.850 --> 37:54.250
to create a brand-new

37:54.280 --> 37:55.150
IP system that belongs

37:55.150 --> 37:55.920
to us?

37:55.920 --> 37:56.920
Isn't that great?

37:58.560 --> 38:00.030
But you should know

38:00.800 --> 38:02.820
maintaining our collaboration with Xinghai

38:02.820 --> 38:04.180
is currently the safest

38:04.230 --> 38:05.510
and the most effective direction.

38:05.510 --> 38:06.400
I know.

38:07.440 --> 38:08.110
But with the way

38:08.110 --> 38:09.600
Xinghai's management staff behave,

38:09.600 --> 38:11.030
something will go wrong sooner or later.

38:11.030 --> 38:12.400
It will also bring huge risks

38:12.400 --> 38:14.330
and hidden dangers to our project.

38:15.800 --> 38:16.800
Besides,

38:16.830 --> 38:18.370
Xinghai has been so unscrupulous

38:18.370 --> 38:19.360
for so long.

38:19.360 --> 38:20.270
Isn't that because of

38:20.270 --> 38:22.400
their relationship with Lu Zhongyue?

38:23.490 --> 38:25.510
Don't you want to take this opportunity

38:25.510 --> 38:26.980
to remove this tumor

38:27.120 --> 38:28.520
and bring in fresh blood?

38:32.790 --> 38:34.790
Then let me ask you a question first.

38:42.190 --> 38:43.800
Are you planning to do this

38:43.800 --> 38:46.490
because Zhou Wan suffered a grievance,

38:46.820 --> 38:49.160
or you've seriously considered

38:49.180 --> 38:50.590
whether it would benefit Lan Yue?
